  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "TUTEMO 图特莫 柜子里摆满了各种厨房配件，零落地分布在小厨房上方的墙壁上。",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "60349827"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/24/1e/241e33c2f36ee2ca21fdb92dffcbf02d.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/aa/15/aa15d4021186b2a7c653af3c6f0814db.jpg",
